      "raw": "<p><a href=\"http://i.imgur.com/wIToLIC.jpg\">![](upload://6KxVNSp0iDDnPo1ZC5Wz3tyUMfO.jpeg)</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So, this weekend my friends and I were playing some sentinels and some tactics, and as the night wound down decided to try making some sentinels characters as Mii fighters in the new super smash bros game. And by some characters, I mean just Tachyon and then we gave up because I&#39;m not particularly skilled with Mii maker.&nbsp;</p><p>Here&#39;s the QR code for this mii so you can scan it and start playing with Tachyon in your game:</p><p>![](upload://zX7jOldHYLZxL5OWDNn1IyCYMfc.jpeg)</p><p>But, of course I&#39;m really posting here because I&#39;m selfish and I want some more sentinels my game without having to put in the work, and I know that there&#39;s a bunch of creative people here who would like the challenge. So I would like to offer up this thread as a place to share Mii&#39;s that you&#39;ve created so that we all can add a full-ish roster of sentinels, or whatever the limitations of the mii maker will allow.&nbsp;</p><p>Also, if you want an easy way of uploading your QR codes that mii maker generates, just go to this website on your 3ds web browser:&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(11, 12, 14); font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', HelveticaNeue, Arial, sans-serif;\">http://webrender.net/imgur/</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
